.el .ds Aq '
.TH ngx-enable 1  "ngx-enable " 
.SH NAME
ngx\-enable \- Enable a disabled site
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBngx\-enable\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISITE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enable a disabled site
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show what would change without touching anything
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISITE\fR>
Site ID (from `ngx ls`) or any of its domain names
